    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game System</h2>\u201cCloudy Days\u201d is an orthodox text adventure. The story is told by clicking on the screen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>&quot;We have learned that a huge asteroid will hit the earth in 10 days.&quot;<br><br><br>Five days ago, in the middle of the autumn holidays, such an absurd statement was suddenly announced.<br>What kind of idiot would frown at such a statement?<br>However, the words were delivered to me through a dirty cathode-ray tube in the voice of an inorganic announcer, not a group of people from some seedy new religion.<br><br>Thus, the world has certainly changed.<br>The social infrastructure completely collapsed.<br>Violent assaults and food fights by desperate people abounded.<br>The world seems to be in a terrible state.<br><br>However, ...... that is only in urban areas.<br>In a rural area like this, the world is no different.<br>For the past five days, there has been no looting or assault in the countryside where I went back home, just a slow, peaceful passage of time.<br><br><br>It was as if there was a gaping hole in time .......<br>In that time, I inadvertently reunited with her.<br>I had done it. ......<br>Oh, how could this happen?<br>It was an event I feared more than the end of the world.",
